{%- comment -%}
  Buy now under a product card, so a product can be bought from the home page
  or a collection without opening it. A product with sizes shows Buy now
  first; a tap swaps it for the sizes, and a size goes straight to checkout.

  Each size is its own little form posting to /cart/add with that variant's
  id, and its button carries Shopify's Buy it now classes: that is what
  Razorpay Magic Checkout takes over (it reads the id from the clicked
  button's form), so the size opens Magic Checkout. Without Magic Checkout,
  scripts-2026.js ([data-buy-now]) adds the size and opens Shopify's checkout.

  Must sit outside the card's own link: a button inside an <a> navigates.
  Theme settings > Product cards turns it off and sets the wording.

  Params: product
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.card_buy_now != false and product.available -%}
  {%- assign buy_label = settings.card_buy_now_label | default: 'Buy now' -%}
  <div class="card-buy" data-card-buy>
    {%- if product.has_only_default_variant -%}
      <form action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" class="card-buy_form">
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
        <button type="button" class="card-buy_btn shopify-payment-button__button shopify-payment-button__button--unbranded" data-buy-now>{{ buy_label }}</button>
      </form>
    {%- else -%}
      <button type="button" class="card-buy_btn" data-card-buy-open aria-expanded="false">{{ buy_label }}</button>
      <div class="card-buy_sizes" data-card-buy-sizes role="group" aria-label="Buy {{ product.title | escape }} now, choose a size" hidden>
        <span class="card-buy_hint">{{ settings.card_buy_now_hint | default: 'Pick a size' }}</span>
        {%- for v in product.variants -%}
          <form action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" class="card-buy_form">
            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
            <button type="button" class="card-buy_size shopify-payment-button__button shopify-payment-button__button--unbranded" data-buy-now{% unless v.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>{{ v.title }}</button>
          </form>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
